                <note rend="inline" type="source">511.3B1/5a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Commission to Negotiate
                            Peace</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-02T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 2,
                                1919—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>3310. Can you inform Department of any reason why Brazil is not signatory of the
                    Arms Traffic Convention?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
